            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "gapch1026"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A nice crunchy change from tossed lettuce salads. I had just enough broccoli and cauliflower in the refrigerator to make one serving. I added dried cranberries and ate the salad with crackers. Thanks for a tasty lunch!",
            "datePublished": "2009-03-06T16:28:45.057Z"
